Error [E0617]: `.timeout` needs exactly one duration
  --> tests/ui/scope_member_timeout_bad_arg.jet:3:13
    |
  3 |     .timeout("soon") {
    |             ^^^^^^^^
 Why: the region must complete within a time budget, written as a duration literal
 Fix: write `.timeout(500ms) { … }` (`ns`/`us`/`ms`/`s`)
